// Public panic: raw and formatted messages, truncation, cleanup failure, workers, tracked and stored callers.
//@ run-pass
//@ slow
//@ revisions: ready raw format owned truncation cleanup invalid_format count unsupported worker worker_again tracked untracked generic value worker_cleanup stored_library stored_wrapper tracked_stored owned_format terminal_argument terminal_argument_again
//@ execution-profile: concurrent
